              "description": "Artificial Intelligence fuels our dreams and nightmares. But while tech giants promise the advent of a new humanity, behind the scenes AI remains totally hidden. While data centers concrete over landscapes and dry up rivers, millions of workers around the world prepare the billions of data that will feed Big Tech's voracious algorithms, at the cost of their mental and emotional health. They are hidden 'in the belly' of AI.\n\nJoin community members and friends of MCSP for this screening of a film that looks beyond the headline grabbing threats of AI to the environmental and human costs.",
